# odoo-fast-report-mapper | python/uv
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
▸ Setup:     uv venv && venv+ && uvpip
▸ Dev:       uv pip install -e ".[dev]"
▸ Run:       odoo-fr-mapper --yaml_path=./reports_yaml
▸ Test:      pytest
▸ Lint:      ruff check . && ruff format --check .
▸ Build:     uv build
▸ Types:     mypy odoo_fast_report_mapper odoo_report_helper
▸ Docs:      https://www.ownerp.com/odoo-fastreport
